   "heading": {
    "en": "Citation and commencement"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "1. This Order is the Infrastructure Protection (Protected Areas) Order 2024 and comes into operation on 30 September 2024."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H2646-A2",
   "no": 2,
   "noLabel": {
    "en": "2."
   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Premises declared to be protected area and surrounding area"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2.—(1) The premises described in the second column of Part 1 of the Schedule are declared to be a protected area for the purposes of the Act, and the person specified in the first column of Part 1 of that Schedule is designated as the authority of the protected area.\n(2) The premises described in Part 2 of the Schedule are specified to be the surrounding area of the protected area for the purposes of sections 27 and 28 of the Act."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H2646-A3",
   "no": 3,
   "noLabel": {
    "en": "3."
   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Revocation"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "3. Revoke the Protected Areas (No. 2) Order 2005 (G.N. No. S 328/2005)."
   }
  },
